{
  "id": "samsung_dns",
  "title": "Configuração via DNS Samsung",
  "parent": "tv_samsung",
  "description": "Tutorial definitivo de DNS para modelos novos (Tizen) e antigos (Série J).",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-indigo-600/10 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-network-wired'></i> Método Alternativo</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Use este método se a loja de apps da sua Samsung estiver bloqueada ou se você preferir não instalar novos aplicativos.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Identifique seu Modelo</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6'>Assista ao vídeo correspondente à aparência do menu da sua TV:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6'><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl'><div class='aspect-video bg-black'><video controls class='w-full h-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/aparelhos/samsung-dns-tizen.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div><div class='p-4 text-center'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>Samsung Tizen (Novas)</p></div></div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl'><div class='aspect-video bg-black'><video controls class='w-full h-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/aparelhos/samsung-dns-serie-j.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div><div class='p-4 text-center'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>Samsung Série J (Antigas)</p></div></div></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Endereço de DNS</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Em ambos os modelos, você deve alterar o DNS para <b>Manual</b> e digitar o IP abaixo:</p><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl mb-6'><p class='text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-black uppercase mb-2'>DNS Principal TopTV</p><h2 class='text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter'>45.139.122.240</h2></div><p class='text-[9px] text-gray-500 italic'>Dica: Após salvar, reinicie a TV tirando-a da tomada por 30 segundos.</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Abra o App Gatilho</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed'>Agora, procure e abra o aplicativo <b>LOOKE</b> ou <b>SMARTUP</b> na sua TV. Eles carregarão o nosso sistema automaticamente.</p></section></div>"
  }
}
